    "detailed_description": "They call you 99, the only human pilot ever to have access to Drifter races. Assisted by Georgia, a mechanical genius, you will show over the seasons that Earth has its rightful place in the Drift League.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.poster.avif?t=1724158839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.webm?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.mp4?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A season is randomly generated and takes place across multiple planets. Between each planet, you will have the opportunity to spend resources to repair or upgrade the Drifter and try to make it to the final race. Between races, you will also have to choose events that can alter the course of the championship.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/6c4ea2d70b112df6bb5ad829f80b99f0.poster.avif?t=1724158839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/6c4ea2d70b112df6bb5ad829f80b99f0.webm?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>By improving your ranking season after season, you will gain access to new Drifters, Events, and Modules to help you compete with the best drivers and reach the top spot in the Drift League.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/93c77cc61ca796fa0304cc11d1d5ad85.avif?t=1724158839\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "They call you 99, the only human pilot ever to have access to Drifter races. Assisted by Georgia, a mechanical genius, you will show over the seasons that Earth has its rightful place in the Drift League.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.poster.avif?t=1724158839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.webm?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/aef9220ef7fdb043c797eb904dbbee3c.mp4?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A season is randomly generated and takes place across multiple planets. Between each planet, you will have the opportunity to spend resources to repair or upgrade the Drifter and try to make it to the final race. Between races, you will also have to choose events that can alter the course of the championship.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/6c4ea2d70b112df6bb5ad829f80b99f0.poster.avif?t=1724158839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/6c4ea2d70b112df6bb5ad829f80b99f0.webm?t=1724158839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>By improving your ranking season after season, you will gain access to new Drifters, Events, and Modules to help you compete with the best drivers and reach the top spot in the Drift League.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2165510/extras/93c77cc61ca796fa0304cc11d1d5ad85.avif?t=1724158839\" /></div>",
